# TypeScript / Next.js rules

## Stack

- Next.js 15 App Router, React 19, TypeScript strict
- Tailwind + shadcn/ui (when UI phase starts)
- ESLint + Prettier

## Patterns

```typescript
import type { RunSummary } from "@/lib/types";

interface Props {
  runs: RunSummary[];
}
```

## Rules

- No `any` — use `unknown` + narrowing
- `"use client"` only when hooks or browser APIs required
- One component per file; PascalCase component filenames
- Type-only imports for types: `import type { ... }`
- No `console.log` in committed code (warn/error only)

## Structure

- `src/app/` — routes and layouts
- `src/components/` — UI components
- `src/lib/` — API client, types, utils
- `src/hooks/` — client hooks
